#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:5
#: 61c56886373140ad90925271c98a8a51
msgid "Internal Leak Failsafe"
msgstr "内部进水失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:7
#: 4eec3ff384bd4ab6af004cd9eb006e33
msgid ""
"If sub is equipped with a leak detector internally, then a failsafe can be "
"enabled when a leak is detected. Sub provides the ability to have up to "
"three detectors. Each detector can be either analog or digital. When a leak "
"from any detector is detected, a failsafe can be enabled to occur."
msgstr ""
"如果水下机器人内部装有进水检测器，则可在检测到进水时启用失控保护。水下机器人最多支持三个检测器，每个检测器可以是模拟或数字类型。当任意检测器检测到进水时，可启用相应的失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:9
#: ab8da4742a724a83a148135d60d9a3d3
msgid ""
"For the remainder of this article, the first leak detector's parameters will"
" used for example."
msgstr "本文其余部分将以第一个进水检测器的参数为例进行说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:12
#: b5e83b5e836643a18ba14edb9dc93134
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "何时触发失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:13
#: ce5567ad398f408ab7f9daf2c587448a
msgid ""
"If :ref:`FS_LEAK_ENABLE<FS_LEAK_ENABLE>` is non-zero, and a detector is "
"attached to either an analog input or GPIO pin on the autopilot, set by the "
":ref:`LEAK1_PIN<LEAK1_PIN>`. Then if the detector is analog, it's considered"
" active (\"1\") if its voltage is > 2.0V. Digital sensors present a normal "
"digital logic level."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`FS_LEAK_ENABLE<FS_LEAK_ENABLE>` 非零，且有检测器连接到飞控上由 "
":ref:`LEAK1_PIN<LEAK1_PIN>` 设置的模拟输入或 GPIO 引脚。那么若检测器为模拟型，其电压 > 2.0V "
"时即视为激活（「1」）。数字传感器则呈现正常的数字逻辑电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:15
#: 4b5006167f4d46bcb3a2ef2080ae0de4
msgid ""
"Whether the active level of an analog sensor or the logic level from a "
"digital sensor is taken as \"dry\" is determined by the "
":ref:`LEAK1_LOGIC<LEAK1_LOGIC>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"模拟传感器的激活电平或数字传感器的逻辑电平是否被视为「干燥」，由 :ref:`LEAK1_LOGIC<LEAK1_LOGIC>` 参数决定。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:17
#: 9852146b331a44668d16e2e8e8c8321e
msgid ""
"In ArduSub firmware prior or equal to 4.5, the input pin must be declared to"
" be analog or digital with the ``LEAKx_TYPE`` parameter."
msgstr "在 4.5 及更早版本的 ArduSub 固件中，必须使用 ``LEAKx_TYPE`` 参数声明输入引脚为模拟或数字类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:19
#: 961bfc6cc2134f1b973be7554ad9592d
msgid ""
"Digital leak detectors should be connected to digital input pins. Some "
"flight controllers support that on :ref:`servo channel ports <main-aux-"
"out>`, in which case the relevant channel(s) must be configured as "
":ref:`common-gpios`."
msgstr ""
"数字式漏水检测器应连接到数字输入引脚。部分飞控支持在 :ref:`舵机通道端口 <main-aux-out>` 上实现此功能，此时相关通道必须配置为 "
":ref:`common-gpios`。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:21
#: bb86c2e018fe467983198799bf9e4e01
msgid ""
"Leak detections can also be triggered from a MAVLink subsystem (matching the"
" autopilot's MAVLink system ID), via the extended form of `SYS_STATUS "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SYS_STATUS>`__ messages. This "
"can be useful for \"remote\" leak detection (e.g. in a separate enclosure to"
" the autopilot), where it may be impractical to run a leak sensor probe to, "
"or if the autopilot does not have enough GPIO pins available for the desired"
" number of probes."
msgstr ""
"漏水检测也可由某个 MAVLink 子系统（与飞控的 MAVLink 系统 ID 匹配）通过扩展形式的 `SYS_STATUS "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SYS_STATUS>`__ "
"消息触发。这对「远程」漏水检测（例如检测器位于与飞控分离的舱体中）很有用，适用于难以将漏水传感器探头布线到飞控处，或飞控没有足够 GPIO "
"引脚满足所需探头数量的情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:24
#: 7cd89d3bcf67470fb0e5ea8f0ebf8028
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "将会发生什么"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:25
#: 69831c5d48344c53b2c2f3cee28ae6eb
msgid ""
"When the failsafe occurs, the action taken is determined by the value of "
":ref:`FS_LEAK_ENABLE<FS_LEAK_ENABLE>`:"
msgstr "失控保护触发时，采取的动作由 :ref:`FS_LEAK_ENABLE<FS_LEAK_ENABLE>` 的值决定："

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:27
#: 5176ee1c20c14f17b2d2e4413db836c3
msgid "**Disabled** (Value 0) will disable the failsafe entirely."
msgstr "**禁用** （值 0）将完全禁用失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:28
#: 042362c87d1a462dbd600cff08594d65
msgid "**Warn Only** (Value 1) will send a \"Leak Detected\" GCS warning message."
msgstr "**仅警告** （值 1）将向 GCS 发送「Leak Detected」（检测到漏水）警告消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:29
#: 0e82a3e1f0914e8cb98c3b7881f1afa2
msgid ""
"On a flight controller with notifying hardware, status LEDs will flash "
"yellow and white, and the buzzer will play a cycle of falling tones"
msgstr "在带有提示硬件的飞控上，状态 LED 将闪烁黄色和白色，蜂鸣器将循环播放下降音调"

#: ../../source/docs/internal-leak-failsafe.rst:30
#: a97c2f09d726449cadb75bece6b31fda
msgid ""
"**Enter SURFACE Mode** (Value 2) will send a warning and return the vehicle "
"to the surface."
msgstr "**进入 SURFACE 模式** （值 2）将发送警告并使载具返回水面。"

